{"id":873,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>为期五日的社区公益支教有序进入收官阶段，为完整落实共青团 “伙伴计划”青少年综合关爱服务，统筹航空科普实操、红色思想教育与阶段性总结工作。7 月 17 日，中北大学航空宇航学院“航心映红岚”暑期社会实践队于岢岚县广惠园社区服务站点开展第五日支教活动，为本轮社区系列公益课堂画上圆满句号。</p><p>拆解水火箭原理，户外实操探索航天。队员结合力学、气压相关专业知识，系统讲解水火箭发射、升空的核心原理，针对操作安全规范进行重点强调。理论讲解完毕后，全体人员前往户外开阔场地分组开展实操演练，学生分组协作组装、调试水火箭，依次完成发射体验，在动手实操中直观理解气压推力相关物理知识。多名学生表示，水火箭实操直观生动，进一步加深了自身对航空航天基础原理的理解。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lM8LriozCsMN-PLImQkM7lbozL8L4L5PozL8nmCbUz6Rnmv0gihFp2hmCIa0U1y8oShRLYyaoR-ZLRL4nR9aoR7DL7LbnzlaLm9iUNrVLlQFMNLDozLYnRWFL49DnRvJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PM4LsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11737&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/B49C30828033D808160C9E50285BEE1F/6C6932D2/386D7\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"400px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lM8LriozCsMN-PLImQkM7lbozL8L4L5PozL8nmCbUz6Rnmv0gihFp2hmCIa0U1y8oShRLYyaoR-ZLRL4nR9aoR7DL7LbnzlaLm9iUNrVLlQFMNLDozLYnRWFL49DnRvJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PM4LsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11737&e=.png\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lU4lrPL7LPn7rRMI8rVnRNsnzlsMl-5YUNVkUm7anm-Ynml0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyZLkhfMSyaMRU8Mzr7M8laM7UDnmlsLzLsLmUDUNM7nmTFnlLPoRrkUNMFL462L7UJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PM4LsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11737&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/080A5044455D7E04D6F57137246BCDF9/EC185BBC/37F0D\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"400px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lU4lrPL7LPn7rRMI8rVnRNsnzlsMl-5YUNVkUm7anm-Ynml0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyZLkhfMSyaMRU8Mzr7M8laM7UDnmlsLzLsLmUDUNM7nmTFnlLPoRrkUNMFL462L7UJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PM4LsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11737&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lMz6rfMz6RLm98MIzr2Lm6koRW2LR657nRWRL4MfM8Uin7L0gihFp2hmCIa0MYhRnkhVnkyPnmQfMzLsUlnRnRG8L8WkUln7Lz62LzUYL4TFnm-DU49PL7MFL4NbMllJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PM4LsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11737&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/7CDED1F6A537ADCD043BBADD17F14239/F26C810C/3995E\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 410px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lMz6rfMz6RLm98MIzr2Lm6koRW2LR657nRWRL4MfM8Uin7L0gihFp2hmCIa0MYhRnkhVnkyPnmQfMzLsUlnRnRG8L8WkUln7Lz62LzUYL4TFnm-DU49PL7MFL4NbMllJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PM4LsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11737&e=.png\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lUmNrPnRARMRlaoI7l8oRTRUmUaolW52UNV2L8LiUlLaU8-0gihFp2hmCIa0L1hVL1hkLYyZnRW2UlVVn7lYUll8nRVVUmUDolU4nzTfLm6FMlUanlUPUNVFLlC8Mm7Jv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PM4LsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11737&e=.png\" vurl=\"/_vsl/2E2B38D2FAAEDE2AE4D1EB469D3E9A27/5D0ED1BA/1F461\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 396px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lUmNrPnRARMRlaoI7l8oRTRUmUaolW52UNV2L8LiUlLaU8-0gihFp2hmCIa0L1hVL1hkLYyZnRW2UlVVn7lYUll8nRVVUmUDolU4nzTfLm6FMlUanlUPUNVFLlC8Mm7Jv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PM4LsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11737&e=.png\"></p><p>观革命影像资料，体悟先辈奋斗精神。实践队播放动画影片《少年毛泽东》，深度串联毛主席与岢岚的红色渊源，详细讲述1948年4月毛主席率领中央机关转战西柏坡途中路居岢岚、接见当地三级干部、留下“岢岚是个好地方”深情赞誉的珍贵史实。同时，结合影像剧情延伸解读岢岚本土革命斗争历程、新时代乡村发展变化展开解读。通过可视化影像素材，引导青少年直观感受革命先辈不畏艰难、奋勇拼搏的精神内核，持续夯实青少年爱国爱乡思想根基。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lLzCrYM47aMm7sUI8laUl7aL4UPLNl5ZU8C4M4LinmCsUm70gihFp2hmCIa0n1y8U1yDLSybL7MfolU4LRv8U8l8U8n7oR-YnRGZnRnkLzrFU4V7LzCiMNVFLzWkUNLJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PM4LsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11737&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/F4B6190CA9D3074CE4CDD822D08D4B15/C1D1656A/12BBC\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 548px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lUNnrVnmCZolVkMIzv8Mm-8UmTfLzG58olWRMRAkUmliMR90gihFp2hmCIa0LkhfMkysoSysol-8MmGYnmLDMm-aUlUsLlMfU8lPoRlbo7QFUlnknm7PLmTFoRlaMzLJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PM4LsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11737&e=.png\"></p><p>全部课程学习结束后，本次阶段性支教结班仪式如期举行。仪式上，实践队员对为期五日的社区公益课堂进行全面复盘总结，梳理航天科普、红色教育、课业辅导等各项教学内容与活动成效。随后，实践队员与在场青少年依次发言，分别分享多日教学、学习过程中的心得体会与成长收获。仪式最后，实践队为全体参与课堂的小朋友发放文具、科普小礼品，以此鼓励大家保持科学探索热情、铭记红色历史，持续树立勤学向上的成长目标。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lLz-raLmv8LNCbLIRrVMRnRnmTRU4C54MmUiU494Um9bL870gihFp2hmCIa0USyPokyZLYy8o7WkoRUaoRGYMzTRnmMkM8-8oRlsL4VVLzrFU874MRUDMRQFL4-anzNJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PM4LsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11737&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/A188348BB84080259CF3B7B485731E15/CA344646/320E9\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"400px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lLz-raLmv8LNCbLIRrVMRnRnmTRU4C54MmUiU494Um9bL870gihFp2hmCIa0USyPokyZLYy8o7WkoRUaoRGYMzTRnmMkM8-8oRlsL4VVLzrFU874MRUDMRQFL4-anzNJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PM4LsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11737&e=.png\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ln7-rZMm9iMzv8nIN7anmG8U8UsM4U5bM4M7M4vZMNnRLm70gihFp2hmCIa0Mky4LYybUSyZn7QfLNl8L4vYL7l8LzGsnm78L7-sL4vDMNMFMlUZMmlsL7nFL4l4oR7Jv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PM4LsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11737&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/4339A8DFA2E43720E4107F140B73766C/5D86570D/35381\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 419px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ln7-rZMm9iMzv8nIN7anmG8U8UsM4U5bM4M7M4vZMNnRLm70gihFp2hmCIa0Mky4LYybUSyZn7QfLNl8L4vYL7l8LzGsnm78L7-sL4vDMNMFMlUZMmlsL7nFL4l4oR7Jv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PM4LsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11737&e=.png\"></p><p>本次支教活动充分整合航天科普实践、红色思政学习、户外文体陪伴与学业帮扶等多元服务，全面完成本次社区“伙伴计划”暑期支教既定任务。下一步，实践队将系统汇总本次基层志愿服务全过程资料，梳理科普教学、红色宣讲的实践经验，以本次支教经历为基础，持续深耕基层青少年公益服务，以青年力量助力县域青少年思想教育与科学启蒙工作。</p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://hkyh.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=lM8LriozCsMN-PLImQkM7lbozL8L4L5PozL8nmCbUz6Rnmv0gihFp2hmCIa0U1y8oShRLYyaoR-ZLRL4nR9aoR7DL7LbnzlaLm9iUNrVLlQFMNLDozLYnRWFL49DnRvJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PM4LsgtA8pUCcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11737&e=.png"}